<gretldata version="1.4" name="series with std" frequency="1" startobs="1978" endobs="2013" type="time-series">
<description>Times series of time-varying coefficients for Okun’s Law in Germany - 
each series with the time-series of its standard errors. The estimation has been
done done by the TVCcalculate function of the TVC package. The data are taken from
the study “On the Time-Varying Relationship Between Unemployment and Output: What 
shapes it?” by João Tovar Jalles (2018) in the Scottish Journal of Political Economy 
66, pp. 605–630. and is proveded in the TVC package.</description>
